        <p>
          It's worth being honest about where the F63 sits relative to Sole's
          full lineup, even though the flagship F80 isn't in the table above.
          The F80 costs more than double the F63's price for a stronger 4.0
          CHP motor and a more modern console — a jump that only makes sense
          for serious daily runners, not the walking-and-light-jogging
          audience the F63 is built for. If that's not you, don't let a
